WQ/Sumeru_73503/Q7350203","priority":5,"questId":73502,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":735020301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":583205754,"text":"Is no one coming today either...?","nextNodeIds":[735020302]},{"nodeId":735020302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":494045786,"text":"Is this the \"front door of the Temple of Knowledge\"?","nextNodeIds":[735020303]},{"nodeId":735020303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":3528770698,"text":"That's right! This is the front door of the Temple of Knowledge. You seem to have solved all my riddles.","nextNodeIds":[735020304]},{"nodeId":735020304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":1924154634,"text":"And that's wonderful! I thought no one would be able to do that today either! Actually, I'm going back to have lunch soon...","nextNodeIds":[735020305]},{"nodeId":735020305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2134699210,"text":"Why did you write these riddles?","nextNodeIds":[735020306]},{"nodeId":735020306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":2863712938,"text":"Because it's fun, of course.","nextNodeIds":[735020307]},{"nodeId":735020307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4247876450,"text":"That was a quick answer!","nextNodeIds":[735020308]},{"nodeId":735020308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":1512373978,"text":"Other than that reason, why do you think I wrote down these riddles?","nextNodeIds":[735020309]},{"nodeId":735020309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":4155174154,"text":"Did you think that I was just enjoying being difficult?","nextNodeIds":[735020310,735020311]},{"nodeId":735020310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3528148442,"text":"Who knows...","nextNodeIds":[735020312]},{"nodeId":735020312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":3825193610,"text":"Hahaha, then you have misunderstood me, like some people in the Akademiya.","nextNodeIds":[735020313]},{"nodeId":735020313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":1688556802,"text":"I wrote these riddles down because I simply enjoy the feeling of pondering that comes with puzzling them out.","nextNodeIds":[735020314]},{"nodeId":735020314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":1611955650,"text":"When you look back at my riddles, you can see that there is always a keyword leading to the final answer.","nextNodeIds":[735020315]},{"nodeId":735020315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":1950941218,"text":"If you use this keyword as a base and keep thinking about it, the final answer will gradually present itself.","nextNodeIds":[735020316]},{"nodeId":735020316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":2865107874,"text":"If I'd simply wanted to make things difficult for others, I would erase all the clues and turn the riddle into a truly unsolvable problem.","nextNodeIds":[735020317]},{"nodeId":735020317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":683427554,"text":"Let's not talk about this now. Since you've solved all my riddles, you can take these.","nextNodeIds":[735020318]},{"nodeId":735020318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20847,"speakerName":"Drusus","textMapHash":3354586346,"text":"This is the reward you've won with your pondering. Keep them.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":735020311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2397562794,"text":"I don't k